### Cita invalida → 400 con los mensajes de validarCita()
POST http://localhost:3001/api/citas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "disenoId": "spooky-coquette",
  "nombreCliente": "Ev",
  "telefono": "123",
  "fecha": "2026-10-18",
  "hora": "08:00",
  "largo": "corto",
  "extras": []
}

### Cita valida → 201 con el total de calcularPrecio()
POST http://localhost:3001/api/citas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "disenoId": "spooky-coquette",
  "nombreCliente": "Evelyn",
  "telefono": "5555-1234",
  "fecha": "2026-11-03",
  "hora": "10:30",
  "largo": "largo",
  "extras": ["cromado"],
  "cupon": "COQUETTE10"
}

